        "id":  "tab-kv-basic",
        "type":  "tab",
        "label":  "KV Host Link Basic Safe Read Write",
        "disabled":  false,
        "info":  "Starter flow for scalar KEYENCE KV Host Link reads and a manual random write/restore check. The write path reads DM100 first, writes a random unsigned word, restores the saved value, and reads again. Use only a controlled test address because a transport or PLC failure can interrupt restoration."
    },
