        "name":  "Start here: read-only first; optional random write + restore",
        "info":  "First trigger Read DM100:U. Only on a controlled test PLC/address, the optional write button reads the original value, writes a random different value, restores the original value, then reads again. Restoration is best effort and cannot be guaranteed after a connection or PLC failure.",
